# Bandit Level 1

 Objective
The objective of Level 1 is to find the password for the next level.

## Command
```bash
ls
The password is stored in a file named -.

---bash
cat ./-

Result
The command displays the password required to log in to Bandit Level 2.

The password is not included in this repository.

